( Expected-error test for element_normal, manual Professional 6.445,
  with mixed direct normals in one group: the Mohr-Coulomb plane has
  the explicit group_materi_plasti_mohr_coul_direct_normal 0 1, the
  tension plane uses group_materi_plasti_tension_direct_normal_automatic
  -yes. Same single row of three quad4 on a support as
  element_normal2d_row_error1: the middle element has a zero
  element_normal. The explicit normal of the OTHER law does not define
  the tension plane, so GNU stops with the same readable input error
  naming element 2, and advises group_materi_plasti_tension_direct_normal.
  Pro 02-08-2026: see SEGUIMIENTO-CONVERGENCIA.md (verification row).
  EXPECTED_ERROR: element_normal is zero for element : 2 )

echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_stress
end_initia

node 1  0 0
node 2  1 0
node 3  2 0
node 4  3 0
node 5  0 1
node 6  1 1
node 7  2 1
node 8  3 1
element 1  -quad4 1 2 5 6
element 2  -quad4 2 3 6 7
element 3  -quad4 3 4 7 8

group_type 0  -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0  1.0
group_materi_plasti_mohr_coul_direct 0  0. 1. 0.
group_materi_plasti_mohr_coul_direct_normal 0  0. 1.
group_materi_plasti_tension_direct 0  0.0
group_materi_plasti_tension_direct_normal_automatic 0  -yes

bounda_dof  0  -ra 1 2 3 4 -ra -velx -vely
bounda_dof  1  -ra 5 6 7 8 -ra -vely
bounda_time 1  1.

control_timestep 0  1. 1.
control_timestep_iterations 0 5
end_data
